1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,153
Which one is big?

2
00:00:02,153 --> 00:00:03,825
Can you point to it?

3
00:00:07,725 --> 00:00:10,582
Yes! This red ball is big.

4
00:00:10,932 --> 00:00:13,008
Big, big, big!

5
00:00:13,758 --> 00:00:15,490
And this one is small.

6
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:17,084
Small, small, small.

7
00:00:19,734 --> 00:00:21,085
Now, who is big?

8
00:00:21,085 --> 00:00:22,080
Mama Bunny,

9
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,573
or Dotty Duckling?

10
00:00:27,473 --> 00:00:29,928
Mama Bunny is big!

11
00:00:30,678 --> 00:00:33,178
Quack! And I am small,

12
00:00:33,178 --> 00:00:34,978
just like Lulu.

13
00:00:35,728 --> 00:00:37,020
Big or small,

14
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,553
we can all help!

15
00:00:41,203 --> 00:00:42,003
Last one!

16
00:00:42,003 --> 00:00:44,402
Who is the smallest: Honey Bunny,

17
00:00:44,402 --> 00:00:45,802
or the tiny snail?

18
00:00:49,702 --> 00:00:51,062
The tiny snail!

19
00:00:51,062 --> 00:00:52,877
Hello, little friend.

20
00:00:53,627 --> 00:00:56,729
Small friends see small things.

21
00:00:57,079 --> 00:00:58,339
Big or small,

22
00:00:58,339 --> 00:01:00,070
we are all special!

23
